{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/498415f19fe035e5e968004519b541de.poster.avif?t=1764956690\" width=1600 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/498415f19fe035e5e968004519b541de.webm?t=1764956690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/498415f19fe035e5e968004519b541de.mp4?t=1764956690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the official soundtrack for the game Oneirophobia.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oneirophobia is a psychological horror game with survival elements. You will experience the role of a person suffering from a fear of dreams and visit various nightmares, the tension of which is conveyed through natural orchestral instruments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/5dc86a0cb2c0312fcec66228d89ae77f.avif?t=1764956690\" width=1000 height=1000 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In addition, this soundtrack features beautiful and emotional compositions by a traditional orchestra, as well as atmospheric ambient music.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This soundtrack and the game itself were developed by an independent solo developer, 1FOREVERS.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>No artificial intelligence was used in the creation of the game or its soundtrack.</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This soundtrack will not be downloaded to the game's root folder, but will be presented as a full-fledged application in your library.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This soundtrack will be available to you in mp3 and flac formats. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Please note that this soundtrack is still under development, so the track list below is not complete!</strong> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721270?t=1764956690","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721270?t=1764956690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/be1ce546a5217706bd595eadc14c7e463f255232/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764956690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/be1ce546a5217706bd595eadc14c7e463f255232/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764956690","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/498415f19fe035e5e968004519b541de.poster.avif?t=1764956690\" width=1600 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/498415f19fe035e5e968004519b541de.webm?t=1764956690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721270/extras/498415f19fe035e5e968004519b541de.mp4?t=1764956690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the official soundtrack for the game Oneirophobia.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oneirophobia is a psychological horror game with survival elements. You will experience the role of a p